{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261124/photo/bkn-20261124041821574-1124_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261124044756\"/><p>捱撞內地女傷者救護車上治理。(胡德威攝)</p><p>尖東發生交通意外。今日(24日)凌晨3時56分，兩名帶有酒意的內地女遊客，據報在附近消遣後離開，當步至康達徑救護站對開時，被一輛的士撞及，涉事的士則不顧而去，兩女報稱受傷，報案求助。救護員到場將兩名傷者送院救治。警員正追查涉事的士不落，並調查意外起因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T21:01:02.183826+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T20:18:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T22:56:00.843692+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T20:54:25.963207+00:00","content_hash":"3672ff7ae787636b1389d1d0232acfd61deb04359a96a23a1a774dcb6e36076e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}